{"title":"Yeti","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 58 Yeti that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/yeti\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/yeti?lv=57\">Lv 57 <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/yeti?lv=58\">Lv 58 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/yeti?lv=59\">Lv 59 <span>15</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/yeti\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>57</b></td><td>406</td><td>35.9</td><td>2,850</td><td class=\"muted\">1,218 · 50.3 · 8,550</td><td>4</td><td>in the wilds around 476, -934</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/yeti?lv=58\" title=\"Pick level 58\"><td><b>58</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>423</td><td>36.4</td><td>2,900</td><td class=\"muted\">1,269 · 51 · 8,700</td><td>3</td><td>in the wilds around 491, -926</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/yeti?lv=59\" title=\"Pick level 59\"><td><b>59</b></td><td>440</td><td>37</td><td>2,950</td><td class=\"muted\">1,320 · 51.8 · 8,850</td><td>15</td><td>in the wilds around 456, -1006</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"yeti\" data-map-level=\"57\">Show level 57 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-2014.5px,378.0px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/7/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1792px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/7/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1792px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/8/-2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2048px;top:-512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/8/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2048px;top:-256px\"><i style=\"left:2043.3px;top:-380.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:2028.1px;top:-374.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:1990.9px;top:-294.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:1907.1px;top:-337.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:2032.3px;top:-349.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:1907.2px;top:-305.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:1940.2px;top:-406.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:1918.3px;top:-339.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:1902.9px;top:-301.8px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 457, -1008 <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li><li>in the wilds around 470, -930 <span class=\"muted\">· 5 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"yeti\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Yeti: <a href=\"#/monster/snow-yeti\">Snow Yeti</a> <span class=\"muted\">(55)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/yeti-ravager\">Yeti Ravager</a> <span class=\"muted\">(60)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/yeti-matriarch\">Yeti Matriarch</a> <span class=\"muted\">(62)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n   